From d4aa26fe20210ad50a278f316191932393a4d116 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shreenidhi Shedi <shreenidhi.shedi@broadcom.com>
Date: Sun, 3 Aug 2025 17:55:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(networkd): add support for rendering bridge devices

This change extends the networkd renderer to support bridges defined
through network config.

Add tests for same.

Signed-off-by: Shreenidhi Shedi <shreenidhi.shedi@broadcom.com>
